  "contentHtml": "<div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d1937c3c8d780eb509be6353ae5d29e5a725cf01\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d1937c3c8d780eb509be6353ae5d29e5a725cf01\" data-orgin-width=\"1278\" data-origin-height=\"867\"></div><p>정주원샘 수행평가 내용을 이용해서 저는 등교수업-개별 실험을 하였습니다~^^</p><p>(정주원선생님 감사해요!)<br><br>그냥 책 내용을 진도 나가는 것보다 재밌었어요!<br><br>이 사진은 제가 미리 해 본 결과고요~</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9329752718e16075c1aca7db6f5c552e5edc2adb\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9329752718e16075c1aca7db6f5c552e5edc2adb\" data-orgin-width=\"540\" data-origin-height=\"960\"></div><p>함께 사용했던 한쇼파일과 활동지 올려드립니다.</p><p>글씨체가 교보손글씨2019체 입니다.</p><p>짧은 csi 드라마 영상(크로마토그래피로 분석하는)도 함께 보여줬어요.</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/68ea5e4ca7ce3f0e96227d6cb8b17ac2becd0d84?download\" data-file-name=\"[탐구]크로마토그래피.hwp\" data-file-size=\"1170432\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansofthwp\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHq%26dataid%3D506%26fileid%3D3%26regdt%3D20201215072020&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F68ea5e4ca7ce3f0e96227d6cb8b17ac2becd0d84')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">[탐구]크로마토그래피</span><span class=\"type\">.hwp</span></div><div class=\"size\">1.12MB</div></div></a></div><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/97e2c520b12796b3219754f802f92b019e6bd500?download\" data-file-name=\"2-4 크로마토그래피를이용한분리.show\" data-file-size=\"1957164\" data-mimetype=\"application/haa